<p>Binary expressions are shown with brackets to reflect the priorities defined in <code>edu-scoring.ast</code>. If you prefer not to see them, open the <strong>View</strong> menu and deselect <strong>Brackets</strong>.</p>
<p>Experiment with the projections so far. You may notice that, in the score for page <code>Theory101</code>, you can select questions from other pages—exactly what we <em>don’t</em> want. Teachers should only grade based on the current page’s questions. That means we need <strong>scoping</strong>, which we’ll cover in the next lesson.</p>


